2:Tde3,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best PTE coaching centre in Dhaka?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Language Academy Bangladesh in Dhanmondi, Dhaka is a top-rated PTE coaching centre offering AI-scored mock tests, expert trainers, and small batches of max 12 students. We offer both online and offline PTE courses for students and professionals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I practice PTE online from Bangladesh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes! Language Academy offers PTE practice online with AI-scored full-length mock tests, detailed analytics, and expert-led review sessions. Our online PTE course gives you the same curriculum, AI mock tests, and trainer support as in-person learners."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I choose the right PTE or IELTS course?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Start with a free consultation. Our academic advisors assess your current English level, timeline, and target score to recommend the perfect PTE or IELTS course and batch for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer flexible PTE coaching schedules?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We run weekday morning, afternoon, and weekend PTE batches so you can fit serious PTE preparation into your busy routine. Both online and offline classes are available."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is AI mock test support included in PTE coaching?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. All PTE courses at Language Academy include unlimited AI-scored full-length mock tests, detailed analytics, and trainer-led review sessions — the best PTE practice online experience in Bangladesh."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the class size in your PTE coaching centre?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We maintain a maximum of 12 students per cohort to ensure personalized PTE coaching attention, stronger accountability, and faster score improvement."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the difference between PTE and IELTS?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"PTE Academic is fully computer-based with AI scoring and results in 1–2 days, while IELTS has a face-to-face speaking test with results in 3–13 days. Both are accepted worldwide. PTE is especially popular for Australia and New Zealand immigration. Language Academy prepares you for both."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What PTE score do I need to study abroad in Australia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"For Australian student visas, you typically need a PTE score of 50–65 depending on the course. For Skilled Migration (PR), a PTE score of 65+ is generally required. Language Academy's PTE coaching is designed to help you achieve 79+ for maximum migration points."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer study abroad consulting from Bangladesh?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Along with PTE coaching and IELTS preparation, Language Academy provides study abroad guidance for Australia, Canada, UK, New Zealand, and more. Our advisors help with university selection, visa requirements, and score targets."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does PTE or IELTS preparation take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most students at Language Academy achieve their target PTE or IELTS score within 4–8 weeks of focused preparation. The exact timeline depends on your current English level and target score. Our online PTE course offers the same intensive experience."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","suppressHydrationWarning":true,"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$L3","$L4"],["$L5"],"$L6"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ax0dFh5Zs23PtZZWrgXZB"}
